ither bridge works for the river crossing. Bushes, and a bridge overhaul. Plant waist-high bushes, and build Arch or Flat bridges in two clicks, at any length. Unplayable lies. In a round, press U (RT on a controller) to take a one-stroke drop, just like the real rules. Smoother and sharper. Better looking grass, SMAA anti-aliasing on Medium and High, and shaping the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T23:02:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688260","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5007720-1846651706679172","game_id":"steam-5007720","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 0.4.2: Anonymous play stats, with an off switch","summary":"A small update with one change worth knowing about for full transparency. New Anonymous play stats, with an off switch. The game now sends Steam a few anonymous numbers, like how far people get in the tutorial and how long they spend building, so we can see what to improve. No personal data is collected: no names, no courses, no chat. Steam adds the numbers up across every player, and we only ever see the totals. Here's everything that's counted: How far players get in the tutorial, and where th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T20:10:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679172","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5007720-1846018067928074","game_id":"steam-5007720","kind":"announcement","title":"Version 0.4.1: Now on Mac, plus Short Rough and reeds","summary":"The demo now runs on Mac! This update also adds Short Rough, reeds for your ponds and a friendlier water tool, plus a handful of fixes. Added macOS support. The demo now runs on Macs through Steam, both Apple Silicon and Intel, and Early Access will too when it starts on 10 November. Cmd works where Windows uses Ctrl, trackpad scroll and pinch zoom the camera smoothly, and Option + drag spins it around. Spoken commentary isn't on Mac yet, so the booth shows its lines as text for now. Short Rough","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T02:16:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928074","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5007720-1845383656383840","game_id":"steam-5007720","kind":"update","title":"Update 0.4.0 is here!","summary":"Items marked (full game) are not available in the demo. Highlights This is a big one, with over 200 changes and fixes. Your course feels a lot more alive, you can play it all on a controller, and there's lots of new stuff to build with. Here are the headlines. Play on a controller. Build, run and play the whole game on a gamepad. Play in your own tournaments. Enter the events you host and win prize money. Aces worth celebrating. Fireworks over the green, an instant replay and an Aces wall in the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T19:52:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656383840","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5007720-1844751498223318","game_id":"steam-5007720","kind":"announcement","title":"Join the Golf Course Architect Tycoon Discord","summary":"I've started a Discord for Golf Course Architect Tycoon! Come share your courses, ask questions, or tell me how the demo went. I'll also share updates and what I'm working on. Join the Discord here If you've built a hole you're proud of, I'd love to see it. And if something confused you in your first ten minutes, I'd really like to hear about that too. Steam discussions are still a great place for questions and feedback, so use whichever you prefer. Thanks for playing, Greg","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T04:27:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498223318","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5007720-1844751498217340","game_id":"steam-5007720","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 0.3.1","summary":"This update adds a bit of new content along with a round of fixes and improvements, a lot of it based on your feedback. A big focus was the lower graphics settings. The Low setting now looks much closer to High, and the game picks sensible settings for your PC on first launch instead of starting everyone on High. That should mean a smoother game without giving up much on looks. On the content side, you can now enter the tournaments you host with your own golfer, and your golfer keeps their score","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T04:20:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498217340","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5007720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:52Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:52Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5007720":"2026-10-26T07:13:52Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5007720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:52Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:52Z"},"5127500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:52Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:13:52Z","status":"ok","err